3862
03:21:51,520 --> 03:21:54,300
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Hindi po tayo sigurado kung konektado ito talaga.

3863
03:21:54,800 --> 03:21:57,860
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: National Highway Network o konektado ito sa mga resort nila.

3864
03:21:58,760 --> 03:22:05,600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: The house inserted 319 totally new irrigation projects worth 9.4 billion pesos.

3865
03:22:06,140 --> 03:22:12,580
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: And the egregious thing about these house insertions is they do not have the same level of public disclosure

3866
03:22:12,580 --> 03:22:15,480
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: that was given by the Department of Public Works and Highways.

3867
03:22:15,920 --> 03:22:20,960
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Nag-publish po sila ng mga geotagged photos, program of works, detailed unit price analysis,

3868
03:22:20,960 --> 03:22:24,200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: certificate of implementability ng mga local government units,

3869
03:22:24,800 --> 03:22:28,340
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: feasibility studies at local development council approvals.

3870
03:22:28,740 --> 03:22:35,240
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Kaya po siguro bahagi po ito kung bakit nag-slow down ang farm-to-market road budget utilization

3871
03:22:35,240 --> 03:22:40,620
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: kasi po kailangan po yung lahat ng dokumentong ito ay present before even the budget is approved.

3872
03:22:42,040 --> 03:22:49,020
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Yung even more details, kailangan pong i-publish hindi lamang ang coordinates pero yung mga supporting documents.

3873
03:22:49,580 --> 03:22:53,480
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Halimbawa po, kailangan pong i-review ang mga coordinates ng proyekto.

3874
03:22:53,600 --> 03:22:54,780
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Nung tinignan po namin,

3875
03:22:54,800 --> 03:22:56,620
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: meron po kaming mga angry nerds.

3876
03:22:56,720 --> 03:23:01,020
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ito po yung 5,500 volunteers, the best software developers in the world

3877
03:23:01,020 --> 03:23:04,080
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: who got politically active after the flood control scandal.

3878
03:23:04,480 --> 03:23:11,540
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We mapped every single project, every single of the 18,000 projects that are now in the House bill.

3879
03:23:12,120 --> 03:23:17,800
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: May mga nakita po kaming 23 million pesos na farm-to-market road na dapat ay nasa Nueva Ecija

3880
03:23:17,800 --> 03:23:21,720
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: pero ang coordinates po ay nasa Karagatan na malapit sa Benham Rice.

3881
03:23:21,720 --> 03:23:24,780
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: May isang 30 million pesos na farm-to-market road na dapat ay nasa Nueva Ecija.

3882
03:23:24,780 --> 03:23:29,100
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: May isang 55 million pesos na farm-to-market road na dapat ay nasa Cebu pero nasa Celebesi, malapit sa Indonesia.

3883
03:23:29,940 --> 03:23:36,320
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: May isang 55 million pesos na farm-to-market road na dapat nasa Quezon pero nasa Karagatan, malapit sa Brunei.

3884
03:23:37,300 --> 03:23:42,580
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Kailangan din po natin i-review ang cost assumptions sa iba-ibang infrastruktura sa farm-to-market at irrigation.

3885
03:23:43,340 --> 03:23:52,780
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Kanina po nasabi na 15,000 pesos per meter or 15 million pesos per kilometer ang market price ngayon dapat ng mga kalsada.

3886
03:23:52,780 --> 03:23:54,360
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: May mga nakita po kami.

3887
03:23:54,780 --> 03:24:04,860
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: May mga koordinates na published na 19 million pesos per meter dahil 2 meters lang po ang nasa koordinates or 6 million pesos per meter.

3888
03:24:05,700 --> 03:24:11,860
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Sa tingin po namin may mga mali sa mga koordinates na ito na napasa both in the NEP and the House version.

3889
03:24:12,460 --> 03:24:19,860
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: At ang nire-request po ng aming angry nerds ay yung mismong raw data, yung mga GeoJSON shape files para ma-verify po ang lahat ng ito.

3890
03:24:20,180 --> 03:24:24,460
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: In the middle of some of these project cost analysis that we did,

3891
03:24:24,780 --> 03:24:30,040
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: may mga nakita pa po kaming mga 33,000 pesos per meter at 20,000 pesos per meter.

3892
03:24:30,160 --> 03:24:35,880
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Gustong sabihin po, if we take the budget as is, may mga likely overpriced projects pa rin po sa DA.

3893
03:24:36,900 --> 03:24:39,660
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ikalawa naman po, tinignan namin ang irrigation projects.

3894
03:24:40,060 --> 03:24:48,080
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Meron po ba kaming nakita na mga solar panels at kung ano man ang mga naging assumption sa mga solar pump irrigation projects.

3895
03:24:48,820 --> 03:24:53,040
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Concerned po kami sa costs ng solar pump irrigation systems with AI capability.

3896
03:24:53,660 --> 03:24:54,220
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Tama po ba?

3897
03:24:54,220 --> 03:24:59,680
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Na bilog-bilog na 50 million, 100 million, o 200 million ang mga budget para rito.

3898
03:25:00,260 --> 03:25:03,700
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: There is a risk that these projects may be overpriced so these must be reviewed.

3899
03:25:04,720 --> 03:25:09,160
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Tinignan po namin kung magkano dapat ang 600 to 700 watt solar panel.

3900
03:25:09,740 --> 03:25:13,160
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Dapat po ito ay under market prices just 7,000 pesos.

3901
03:25:13,760 --> 03:25:17,460
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: But some bidding and detailed unit price analysis documents are team reviewed.

3902
03:25:18,480 --> 03:25:22,920
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Nakita po na yung solar panel costs na ito, actual bidding documents coming from the NIA,

3903
03:25:22,920 --> 03:25:25,920
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: cost around 30,000 to 40,000 pesos.

3904
03:25:26,420 --> 03:25:35,800
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: So we want to ask whether these are still the same cost assumptions being used for the irrigation projects under this budget.

3905
03:25:36,760 --> 03:25:39,600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Meron din pong mga AI monitoring section ang mga proyektong ito.

3906
03:25:40,060 --> 03:25:44,240
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Dapat po ba talaga ay merong tigo 1 million pesos per lot na AI monitoring?

3907
03:25:44,800 --> 03:25:46,580
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Hindi po ba dapat mas centralized na ito?

3908
03:25:47,180 --> 03:25:52,740
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Again, we are not saying that these are conclusive of corruption because we need more documents to make a determination.

3909
03:25:53,340 --> 03:26:01,840
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ang sinasabi lamang po namin, kailangan po ng determination at kailangan ng dokumento para po magkaroon tayo ng mas maayos na review.

3910
03:26:02,420 --> 03:26:04,580
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Pinublish po namin ang findings na ito.

3911
03:26:04,580 --> 03:26:13,200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We have a listing of all 18,000 house projects in this link, bit.ly or bit.ly slash budget red flags.

3912
03:26:13,760 --> 03:26:20,200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Iniimbitahan po namin ang media, civil society, at ang kongreso at akademya to work with us on these inspections.

3913
03:26:20,800 --> 03:26:22,800
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Kung ang eleksyon po ay may disiplina ng eleksyon.

3914
03:26:22,920 --> 03:26:26,540
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Sa budget naman po ay dapat may budget monitoring.

3915
03:26:27,280 --> 03:26:31,060
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: So yun po yung first major finding namin sa NKICO and SPWIN.

3916
03:26:31,880 --> 03:26:37,700
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ikalawa po is an offer to support the great work of Secretary Kiko Chulaurel and the DA family.

3917
03:26:38,280 --> 03:26:41,200
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We commend the DA for launching the Farm to Markets Roadwatch.

3918
03:26:41,620 --> 03:26:52,660
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Nakita po namin na sa DA may website sila na inupload ang 3,455 completed projects of 6,428 projects worth 110 billion pesos.

3919
03:26:52,660 --> 03:26:55,600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Spanning nearly 2,700 kilometers.

3920
03:26:56,380 --> 03:27:04,060
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: However po, when we saw the public reports in your e-reports portal, only 24 reports have been submitted by citizen inspectors.

3921
03:27:04,560 --> 03:27:09,760
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Ang offer po for support namin, we think we can support the citizen monitoring of these farm to market roads.

3922
03:27:10,220 --> 03:27:16,140
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: And perhaps we can work with the Bisto Proyecto group convened by Cardinal Ambo David and Dondon Parafina.

3923
03:27:16,140 --> 03:27:22,640
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Our more than 200 volunteers, mga nanays ng 4Ps, Rover Scouts, mga madre at pare,

3924
03:27:22,660 --> 03:27:30,500
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: at parish workers, have monitored 251 projects worth 14 billion pesos across 12 regions with the DPWH.

3925
03:27:31,020 --> 03:27:35,660
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: May nahanap po kami na 92 na unsatisfactory na projects.

3926
03:27:36,100 --> 03:27:37,180
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Siyem na po ang narisolba.

3927
03:27:37,860 --> 03:27:43,140
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: And inaayos po namin ngayon with DPWH yung feedback mechanism with citizen inspectors.

3928
03:27:43,480 --> 03:27:46,340
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We hope that we can do the same with your office, Secretary.

3929
03:27:47,060 --> 03:27:48,000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Third and final.

3930
03:27:48,000 --> 03:27:52,640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Before you proceed, just to place on record, let it be on record.

3931
03:27:52,660 --> 03:28:05,060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: That when Mr. Abante said, we hope you can help us directing the question or the appeal to the good Secretary,

3932
03:28:05,540 --> 03:28:08,220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: the Secretary gave a thumbs up.

3933
03:28:08,820 --> 03:28:12,640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: That's not in the transcript kasi so I had to put it on record.

3934
03:28:13,240 --> 03:28:15,680
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: We are very happy with the thumbs up, Your Honor.

3935
03:28:17,060 --> 03:28:18,400
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Third and finally po,

3936
03:28:18,400 --> 03:28:22,300
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: we hope po we can involve the scientists in the review of the budget

3937
03:28:22,300 --> 03:28:28,000
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: to address El Niño, to double-check many of these coordinates that we think have errors in them,

3938
03:28:28,000 --> 03:28:30,880
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: and promote the stability of the agriculture prices.

3939
03:28:30,880 --> 03:28:36,140
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: At sa tingin po namin, it's part of the institutionalization of the Budget Monitoring Group,

3940
03:28:36,140 --> 03:28:42,440
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Budget Monitoring Network, is to be able to fund these third-party research institutions

3941
03:28:42,440 --> 03:28:48,240
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: so that they can really attend and do detailed analyses and studies of these projects.

3942
03:28:48,240 --> 03:28:51,600
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: Muli po, nagpapasalamat po kami kasi ito po ay napakahalagang

3943
03:28:52,140 --> 03:28:56,040
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: oportunidad para po sa aming mga budget watchdogs na mapakinggan.

3944
03:28:57,120 --> 03:29:02,640
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: At si Tim po ay mayroon din po siyang mga inputs galing po sa mga farmers and fisher folks,

3945
03:29:03,100 --> 03:29:07,360
People's Budget Coalition Co-convenor Kenneth Isaiah Ibasco Abante: fisher folk groups, and may we ask po that Tim be recognized, Mr. Chairman.

3946
03:29:07,380 --> 03:29:08,360
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Go ahead, Tim.

3947
03:29:08,360 --> 03:29:08,760
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Mr. Chairman.

3948
03:29:09,260 --> 03:29:09,540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

3949
03:29:09,800 --> 03:29:16,660
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Just on the topic ni Ken, kasi nabuksan niya yung farm-to-market roads,

3950
03:29:16,660 --> 03:29:20,540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: and I just want to share with the Secretary,

3951
03:29:20,540 --> 03:29:24,920
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: alam ko linilinis na ito ng department, pero mayroon pa rin kaming nakitang mga,

3952
03:29:25,480 --> 03:29:30,640
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: we call it red flags rin, in line with what Ken mentioned.

3953
03:29:30,640 --> 03:29:36,900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And Mr. Chairman, thank you rin for inviting the People's Budget Coalition.

3954
03:29:37,100 --> 03:29:38,840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We've been working with them since last year.

3955
03:29:39,960 --> 03:29:46,740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In fact, malaki po yung kanilang papel kung paano natin inayos yung 2026 budget.

3956
03:29:47,660 --> 03:29:50,900
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At dahil sa pagtutulungan natin,

3957
03:29:52,140 --> 03:29:57,220
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: yung recent Supreme Court ruling, hindi apektado yung 2026 budget.

3958
03:29:57,420 --> 03:30:00,020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: It's only on the 2024 and 2025 budget.

3959
03:30:00,280 --> 03:30:12,620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And that's also with the close coordination with our civil society organization, kay Sen. Kiko, nung hinimay niya mga farm-to-market roads at irrigation projects.

3960
03:30:13,280 --> 03:30:21,100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, Secretary, may nakita pa kami yung tawag namin mga red flags, mga 29 projects worth P660 million.

3961
03:30:21,100 --> 03:30:27,520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I know this is not big compared to the P16 billion total FMR.

3962
03:30:28,180 --> 03:30:41,860
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pero dahil yung Kongreso nagpasok ng P6 billion, hindi namin alam kung yung P6 billion na yun ay naayon sa inyong master list or master plan.

3963
03:30:42,600 --> 03:30:46,500
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, but nakita namin may mga ganitong mga red flag.

3964
03:30:47,020 --> 03:30:48,340
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Next slide, Elena.

3965
03:30:48,600 --> 03:30:50,960
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: First yung the same name.

3966
03:30:51,100 --> 03:30:55,540
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, nakita namin doon sa mga FMR may mga pare-pareho yung pangalan.

3967
03:30:56,300 --> 03:30:56,940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Next.

3968
03:30:58,400 --> 03:31:02,800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: The same name, but different project coordinates.

3969
03:31:03,040 --> 03:31:07,140
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Pag tinignan natin yung pangalan, pare-pareho, pero hindi man pareho yung coordinates.

3970
03:31:07,580 --> 03:31:08,780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then next.

3971
03:31:10,340 --> 03:31:12,560
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Different name, but the same coordinates.

3972
03:31:13,020 --> 03:31:18,600
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Ito mas delikado ito dahil iba yung pangalan, pero parehong coordinates.

3973
03:31:18,600 --> 03:31:20,100
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yun yung sinabi kanina ni Ken.

3974
03:31:20,260 --> 03:31:20,460
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Baka.

3975
03:31:21,100 --> 03:31:22,060
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Nasa ibang lugar.

3976
03:31:22,360 --> 03:31:27,940
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: I think, baka may, to give the benefit of the doubt, baka mali lang i-input, no, nung numbers.

3977
03:31:28,080 --> 03:31:29,080
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Kasi puro numbers yan.

3978
03:31:29,720 --> 03:31:38,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But when I received a briefing from the People's Budget Coalition, may mga coordinates na nasa, no, nasa Benham Rise.

3979
03:31:39,040 --> 03:31:42,360
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Yung iba, nasa ibang, hindi nasa Pilipinas, no.

3980
03:31:43,460 --> 03:31:47,800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And then next, ito rin, delikado rin ito.

3981
03:31:47,800 --> 03:31:50,800
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, the same project, the same coordinates, reappearing independently.

3982
03:31:51,100 --> 03:31:51,740
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Different years.

3983
03:31:52,480 --> 03:31:52,620
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: No?

3984
03:31:52,780 --> 03:31:56,780
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And we only compared 2026 and 2027.

3985
03:31:57,000 --> 03:32:00,020
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Baka meron pa yan sa 2025, 2024.

3986
03:32:01,020 --> 03:32:03,520
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, fina-flag lang namin in department.

3987
03:32:03,720 --> 03:32:07,720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We just want to let the department know may mga ganitong red flags.

3988
03:32:07,840 --> 03:32:12,880
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We'll be more than happy to share with the department itong list para malinis ninyo yung inlistahan.

3989
03:32:12,880 --> 03:32:20,720
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: And with the recent amendment or insertion ng house na 6 billion, we will also review this.

3990
03:32:21,100 --> 03:32:24,980
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In cooperation with our civil society organization.

3991
03:32:25,200 --> 03:32:29,260
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But sa department, gawin nyo na rin yung review.

3992
03:32:30,200 --> 03:32:34,840
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At yun naman yung agreement natin, dapat pasok siya doon sa inyong master plan.

3993
03:32:35,560 --> 03:32:39,180
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Para everything is coordinated with the department.

3994
03:32:39,600 --> 03:32:40,380
Senator Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

3995
03:32:41,160 --> 03:32:44,120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Thank you, Senate President, Mr. President.

3996
03:32:44,300 --> 03:32:45,500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Go ahead, Tim. You have the floor.

3997
03:32:47,160 --> 03:32:48,180
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Magandang hapon po.

3998
03:32:48,380 --> 03:32:50,500
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Timothy Salamon from People's Budget Coalition.

3999
03:32:50,500 --> 03:32:53,280
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Representing Task Force Mapalad National Peasant Federation.

4000
03:32:54,040 --> 03:32:59,700
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: One million farmers across the nation that availed of the land rights through the Agrarian Reform Program.

4001
03:33:00,260 --> 03:33:01,020
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Maraming salamat po.

4002
03:33:01,620 --> 03:33:06,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Actually, pinapunta ko dito ng elders ko, si na Christian Munzod, Atty. Christian Munzod.

4003
03:33:06,600 --> 03:33:07,740
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Atty. Manding Harilia.

4004
03:33:08,060 --> 03:33:10,660
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: They wanted me to take an angry tone.

4005
03:33:11,200 --> 03:33:15,220
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Pero upon hearing the discussion earlier, sabi ko kay Atty. Christian.

4006
03:33:15,820 --> 03:33:18,300
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Atty. Christian, parang binibigay nila yung gusto nila atin makuha.

4007
03:33:19,400 --> 03:33:20,320
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Natuwa po kami.

4008
03:33:20,500 --> 03:33:23,060
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Yung doon sa discussion regarding doon sa RSSI.

4009
03:33:24,260 --> 03:33:28,140
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: We do note just some further details on this.

4010
03:33:28,140 --> 03:33:29,900
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Napakalaking bagay po kasi nito.

4011
03:33:34,660 --> 03:33:43,140
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Ano po eh, nabanggit kanina, napakamahal nung insecticides that are being purchased for RSSI.

4012
03:33:43,140 --> 03:33:45,440
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: I believe from 10,000 per hectare po iyon.

4013
03:33:46,040 --> 03:33:50,480
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: And we do note na napakababa ng budget na binigay sa SRE.

4014
03:33:50,500 --> 03:33:51,940
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: To deal with that insect.

4015
03:33:52,940 --> 03:34:00,360
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: And natutuwa po kami na the SRE has already mentioned that there are biocontrol mechanisms to deal with this.

4016
03:34:00,440 --> 03:34:06,360
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: We already submit this to the DA and we are glad na nakinig po kayo sa recommendations sa civil society.

4017
03:34:06,860 --> 03:34:12,460
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: In fact, 10,000 per hectare po yung synthetic pesticide.

4018
03:34:12,520 --> 03:34:14,580
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Yung sinasuggest po namin na biocontrol.

4019
03:34:14,660 --> 03:34:16,460
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: 2,600 per hectare lang.

4020
03:34:16,820 --> 03:34:18,180
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Nabibili po mo siya Shopee.

4021
03:34:18,620 --> 03:34:20,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Tapos pag binili mo siya Shopee,

4022
03:34:20,160 --> 03:34:25,680
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: pwede mo siyang padamihin sa isang lab na kayang gawin ng mga agricultural students.

4023
03:34:26,500 --> 03:34:28,480
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So, we do support that budget.

4024
03:34:28,640 --> 03:34:31,860
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Sana pataasin po yung pagkontrol mismo dito sa peste na ito.

4025
03:34:31,940 --> 03:34:35,340
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: In fact, itong peste na RSSI, kapatid po siya ng cocolisap.

4026
03:34:36,100 --> 03:34:36,860
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Sen Pangilinan.

4027
03:34:37,540 --> 03:34:42,020
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Pareho silang, they bore into the actual cane.

4028
03:34:42,520 --> 03:34:43,760
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Tapos sisip-sipin ngayon tamis.

4029
03:34:43,920 --> 03:34:45,260
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Kaya siya masama siya sa sugar.

4030
03:34:46,280 --> 03:34:47,980
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So, I also wanted to,

4031
03:34:47,980 --> 03:34:50,100
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: kung ano po yung ginawa,

4032
03:34:50,160 --> 03:34:52,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: kung ano po yung ginawa nyo sa coconut,

4033
03:34:52,160 --> 03:34:54,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: please do it with sugar.

4034
03:34:54,160 --> 03:34:59,540
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Kasi ang dami pong nawawalan ng hanap buhay dahil dito siya sa cocolisap.

4035
03:34:59,540 --> 03:35:02,540
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: I just wanted to follow up po.

4036
03:35:02,540 --> 03:35:04,540
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Deliver niyo po yung budget na yung DA.

4037
03:35:04,540 --> 03:35:07,540
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Hingin niyo po sa Senate yung susuportahan po ng civil society.

4038
03:35:07,540 --> 03:35:09,540
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Yung hihingin ninyo.

4039
03:35:09,540 --> 03:35:11,540
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Kasi napakadami po talaga ng apektado.

4040
03:35:11,540 --> 03:35:13,540
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Pangalawa po,

4041
03:35:13,540 --> 03:35:17,540
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: hindi lang po sana namin gusto gawin ito sa sugar.

4042
03:35:17,540 --> 03:35:19,540
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Nabanggit na rin doon sa usapan with

4043
03:35:20,160 --> 03:35:22,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Sen Zubiri

4044
03:35:22,160 --> 03:35:26,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: na napakalaki nung issue nung access to fertilizer and pesticides na imported.

4045
03:35:26,160 --> 03:35:28,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: And we do note that

4046
03:35:28,160 --> 03:35:30,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: bukod sa mahal,

4047
03:35:30,160 --> 03:35:32,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: nakakasira siya sa lupa.

4048
03:35:32,160 --> 03:35:34,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Tapos there are actually reports that

4049
03:35:34,160 --> 03:35:37,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: we are still using about seven fertilizers,

4050
03:35:37,160 --> 03:35:39,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: particularly ang banana,

4051
03:35:39,160 --> 03:35:43,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: na banned na sa European Union and the US.

4052
03:35:43,160 --> 03:35:45,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: We need to take it.

4053
03:35:45,160 --> 03:35:49,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: We will submit you the list of the actual names of the fertilizers.

4054
03:35:49,160 --> 03:35:51,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So this is the point is to say

4055
03:35:51,160 --> 03:35:55,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: that we wanted to veer away from importing fertilizers and pesticides.

4056
03:35:55,160 --> 03:35:57,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: And to develop our own industry.

4057
03:35:57,160 --> 03:36:04,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: To develop more nature-based and farmer-friendly inputs to farming.

4058
03:36:04,160 --> 03:36:06,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: In essence kasi,

4059
03:36:06,160 --> 03:36:08,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: you take away the money from importing.

4060
03:36:08,160 --> 03:36:10,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Pag ininvest mo siya sa baba,

4061
03:36:10,160 --> 03:36:13,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: magdadagdag ka ng value na pwede i-create nung farmer.

4062
03:36:13,160 --> 03:36:15,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Dagdag income sa kanya kasi yun e

4063
03:36:15,160 --> 03:36:17,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: pag siya yung gumawa ng mismo fertilizer.

4064
03:36:17,160 --> 03:36:21,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Pag mayroon mo pa yung lupa kasi hindi mo sinira because of synthetic fertilizer.

4065
03:36:21,160 --> 03:36:23,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So we do encourage this.

4066
03:36:23,160 --> 03:36:24,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Sana po makita namin ito.

4067
03:36:24,160 --> 03:36:30,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Ang tagal na namin pinapush ito throughout all of the commodity chains.

4068
03:36:30,160 --> 03:36:32,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So yun po yung mga natutuwa kami.

4069
03:36:32,160 --> 03:36:36,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Some points that we remain concerned about.

4070
03:36:36,160 --> 03:36:38,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Mayroon po rin pong reports that

4071
03:36:38,160 --> 03:36:44,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: I think Inquire published that about 40% of our farming and fishing population

4072
03:36:44,160 --> 03:36:46,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: remains to be registered with the RSVSA.

4073
03:36:47,160 --> 03:36:49,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So we wanted to press na

4074
03:36:49,160 --> 03:36:53,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: sana may action plan to deal with this gap on registration.

4075
03:36:53,160 --> 03:36:55,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: From what we also understand,

4076
03:36:55,160 --> 03:36:58,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: most of the consequential services of the DA require

4077
03:36:58,160 --> 03:37:01,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: some form of registration.

4078
03:37:01,160 --> 03:37:05,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Magiging farmers association or fisher folk association.

4079
03:37:05,160 --> 03:37:07,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: And yet the numbers do tell,

4080
03:37:07,160 --> 03:37:10,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: and this is from a report by the ATI themselves,

4081
03:37:10,160 --> 03:37:15,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: na 80% lang ng farmers natin ang may access to organizational registration.

4082
03:37:15,160 --> 03:37:16,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So in essence,

4083
03:37:16,160 --> 03:37:17,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: by that policy,

4084
03:37:17,160 --> 03:37:24,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: only 20% are reached by very big agricultural support services.

4085
03:37:24,160 --> 03:37:30,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: And ito po, problema ko po yun kasi ang laki po ng budget ng DA.

4086
03:37:30,160 --> 03:37:34,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Ang ibig sabihin mo ba nun 20% lang talaga yung balak natin pagsisilbihan?

4087
03:37:34,160 --> 03:37:38,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: We already suggested from the last budget,

4088
03:37:38,160 --> 03:37:40,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: nag-participate din po kasi kami doon.

4089
03:37:40,160 --> 03:37:44,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: We issued questions to the House of Representatives sa DA last year.

4090
03:37:44,160 --> 03:37:48,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Nag-commit po ang ating DA to invest on community organizing

4091
03:37:48,160 --> 03:37:53,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: or in improving yung pag-fe-federate ng mga farmers

4092
03:37:53,160 --> 03:37:55,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: into actual agricultural cooperatives.

4093
03:37:55,160 --> 03:37:58,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Hindi ko po nakita where that promise went.

4094
03:37:58,160 --> 03:38:04,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Pero I do recognize that this is already in the bill of the good senator na ano yung

4095
03:38:04,160 --> 03:38:07,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: agricultural extension and cooperatives bills.

4096
03:38:07,160 --> 03:38:11,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Bukod po dito, hindi naman po kailangan po yung batas,

4097
03:38:11,160 --> 03:38:13,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: but we also note na hindi din po gumagalaw yung,

4098
03:38:14,160 --> 03:38:18,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: civil society led na Philippine Action Plan for Family Farming.

4099
03:38:18,160 --> 03:38:20,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: We already participated heavily on this.

4100
03:38:20,160 --> 03:38:22,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: It was inked on 2019.

4101
03:38:22,160 --> 03:38:27,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Ang pinaka thesis po, pinaka point po ng policy na ito,

4102
03:38:27,160 --> 03:38:32,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: is to ensure that agricultural services do not remain with yung SUKI system,

4103
03:38:32,160 --> 03:38:34,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: yung mga laging binibigyan,

4104
03:38:34,160 --> 03:38:38,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: but actually penetrate yung family farms, yung mga poor smallholder farmers.

4105
03:38:38,160 --> 03:38:42,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Na siya talagang yung majority of our farming population.

4106
03:38:42,160 --> 03:38:43,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So,

4107
03:38:43,160 --> 03:38:44,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: I invite everyone.

4108
03:38:44,160 --> 03:38:48,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Tingnan po natin yun, hindi po siya financed properly since 2019.

4109
03:38:48,160 --> 03:38:53,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Hopefully, yung ATI also, si Ma'am Ricotera, we are very familiar.

4110
03:38:53,160 --> 03:38:57,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Sana po pwede niyo po i-submit kina, Senator Kiko, kung ano po yung

4111
03:38:57,160 --> 03:38:59,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: kailangan ninyong budget para supportahan.

4112
03:38:59,160 --> 03:39:02,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Kasi essentially, what we want with the PAP for FF,

4113
03:39:02,160 --> 03:39:04,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Action Plan on Family Farming,

4114
03:39:04,160 --> 03:39:08,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: is to strengthen the citizenship of farmers and fishers.

4115
03:39:08,160 --> 03:39:12,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: To take, to influence the actual delivery of services.

4116
03:39:12,160 --> 03:39:19,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Kasi maganda po yung agri-extension na the government wants to go closer to the farmers.

4117
03:39:19,160 --> 03:39:24,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Pero the intent of the PAP for FF is that the farmers themselves access it.

4118
03:39:24,160 --> 03:39:27,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Kumbaga, this is the demand side na nag-e-empower ng farmers.

4119
03:39:27,160 --> 03:39:30,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So, hopefully po, at this point.

4120
03:39:30,160 --> 03:39:31,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Last point na lang po.

4121
03:39:31,160 --> 03:39:36,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: We echo the point of Senator Ratul Tulfo that we want to pass the National Land Use Act.

4122
03:39:36,160 --> 03:39:37,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Erwin.

4123
03:39:37,160 --> 03:39:40,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Ah, Erwin po. Erwin, yeah.

4124
03:39:40,160 --> 03:39:41,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Na ano?

4125
03:39:41,160 --> 03:39:49,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Concerned po kami kasi it's been a decade na rin that we've been converting more than we've been irrigating.

4126
03:39:49,160 --> 03:39:51,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Consistent po yun.

4127
03:39:51,160 --> 03:39:58,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: We've been irrigating at least 30% lang nung nako-convert every year in terms of coverage.

4128
03:39:58,160 --> 03:40:04,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Tapos, sobrang dami yung farmers groups that issue concerns of accessing information on irrigation.

4129
03:40:04,160 --> 03:40:09,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Kasi ang policy po ng DA, which we appreciate, meron siyang public consultation.

4130
03:40:09,160 --> 03:40:14,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Merong public consultations every time there's reclassification ng local government units.

4131
03:40:14,160 --> 03:40:16,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Tsaka may conversion with the DAR.

4132
03:40:16,160 --> 03:40:20,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Ang problema, wala kasing access yung farmers dun sa irrigation data.

4133
03:40:20,160 --> 03:40:23,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: And therefore, hindi sila makapag-participate meaningfully.

4134
03:40:23,160 --> 03:40:30,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Di ko alam, I give the benefit of the doubt, this might just be a technological issue or technical issue na hindi mabigay yung data.

4135
03:40:30,160 --> 03:40:37,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Pero sana, sana hindi po ano, sana seryosohin na po ito.

4136
03:40:37,160 --> 03:40:42,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: Kasi mauubos na po yung sakahan natin at hindi pa rin napapasa yung Land Use Act.

4137
03:40:42,160 --> 03:40:49,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So in the meantime, baka pwede po ito gawin ng DA na everybody gets access to that information.

4138
03:40:49,160 --> 03:40:56,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So that we could meaningfully participate when any farmland is being applied for conversion.

4139
03:40:56,160 --> 03:40:58,160
CODE-NGO Project Coordinator Timothy Salomon: So yun po, salamat.

4140
03:40:58,160 --> 03:41:01,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, thank you Tim.

4141
03:41:01,160 --> 03:41:06,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Just to inform you also, it's actually the measures that we have passed on.

4142
03:41:07,160 --> 03:41:11,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Third reading in the Senate are twin measures.

4143
03:41:11,160 --> 03:41:18,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The Extension Services and the Bureau of Agriculture and Fisheries Co-ops re-establishing.

4144
03:41:18,160 --> 03:41:36,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: In other words, the organizing, the development of the agri-coops, we will now place under the Department of Agriculture rather than with the Cooperative Development Authority.

4145
03:41:36,160 --> 03:41:40,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The CDA will handle the regulation.

4146
03:41:40,160 --> 03:41:51,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But the strengthening and building and developing the agri-coops will be directly handled by the Department of Agriculture.

4147
03:41:51,160 --> 03:42:05,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Which was what it was before the devolving of the agri.

4148
03:42:06,160 --> 03:42:08,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: To the local governments.

4149
03:42:08,160 --> 03:42:19,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So there used to be a Bureau of Agriculture and Fisheries Extension Services and a Bureau of Agriculture and Fisheries Co-op.

4150
03:42:19,160 --> 03:42:28,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So ibabalik natin dahil nga kailangan ng directang suporta hanggang sa grassroots level ang ating mga magsasaka at mga anginista.

4151
03:42:28,160 --> 03:42:33,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So thank you for the inputs of Tim and Ken.

4152
03:42:33,160 --> 03:42:35,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, go ahead sir.

4153
