DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Para open at walang, ang request kasi ng DA is yung 20 billion doon sa IDCA funds na every year bibigay sa amin.

4155
03:42:58,160 --> 03:43:04,160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Basis sa rules of the GAAA, hindi namin magagamit for next year eh.

4156
03:43:04,160 --> 03:43:05,160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So sayang.

4157
03:43:06,160 --> 03:43:16,160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: So ang sinasabi namin kung pwedeng tanggalin yan sa aming budget next year at ilipat na lang sa 2028 when we are ready to implement that.

4158
03:43:16,160 --> 03:43:22,160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: And ibalik yung regular budget namin for 2027.

4159
03:43:22,160 --> 03:43:34,160
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Kasi with the way things are instructed doon sa GAAA for 2027, November na namin matatapos yung, November 2027 matatapos yung restructuring ng DA laws.

