Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, thank you. Thank you for that, Sec. I just wanted to clarify, going back to the budget, yung biosafety na 1 billion which we restored last year, may we know what's the status? Kasi my understanding is hindi pa ito na didisburst, hindi pa na-obligate.

4165
