4166
03:44:36,260 --> 03:44:38,740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So you expect the SARO to be released anytime?

4167
03:44:39,220 --> 03:44:40,140
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair.

4168
03:44:40,140 --> 03:44:50,640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, thank you. So that's good news. Dito sa solar power irrigation for 2025, yung nabanggit ng COA na

4169
03:44:50,640 --> 03:45:00,020
