4171
03:45:06,620 --> 03:45:11,560
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair, na-re-issue lang sa amin yung SARO niyan a few months ago.

4172
03:45:11,880 --> 03:45:18,480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Oh, just a few months ago. Okay. So, andyan na? Ready for...

