Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: they had targets.

6663
06:00:36,000 --> 06:00:42,140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The per capita income of our farmers was $500 per capita.

6664
06:00:42,500 --> 06:00:45,740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It is now $900 in the next 10 years.

6665
06:00:45,740 --> 06:00:48,660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It will be $2,000 per capita.

6666
06:00:49,780 --> 06:00:50,620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So something like that.

6667
06:00:51,080 --> 06:00:52,460
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So benchmark na naman ang income.

6668
06:00:53,580 --> 06:00:56,940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And that should be, I think, something that before you,

6669
06:00:56,940 --> 06:00:59,400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: before you leave the bureaucracy,

6670
06:00:59,620 --> 06:01:02,300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: or if you're reappointed by the next administration,

6671
06:01:03,120 --> 06:01:04,160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I hope,

6672
06:01:04,440 --> 06:01:08,020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sec. Kiko, you can do that.

6673
06:01:08,620 --> 06:01:12,420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Come up with the benchmarking of incomes across subsectors

6674
06:01:12,420 --> 06:01:14,960
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: so that we know where we are

6675
06:01:14,960 --> 06:01:17,000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and we know where we want to go

6676
06:01:17,000 --> 06:01:21,480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: with respect to farmers' income

6677
06:01:21,480 --> 06:01:24,960
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and yung kita nila and yung income nila.

6678
06:01:25,800 --> 06:01:26,620
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Mr. Chair?

6679
06:01:26,940 --> 06:01:29,040
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Thank you for your insights and your guidance

6680
06:01:29,040 --> 06:01:31,200
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: and we will proceed accordingly

6681
06:01:31,200 --> 06:01:32,960
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: and follow your lead.

6682
06:01:33,520 --> 06:01:34,360
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Maganda ho yun.

6683
06:01:35,400 --> 06:01:38,640
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Honestly, hindi ko masyadong tugunan ng pansin

6684
06:01:38,640 --> 06:01:40,560
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: but we will get you on to it.

6685
06:01:42,180 --> 06:01:43,480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Thank you very much.

6686
06:01:43,480 --> 06:01:45,120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, before we wrap up,

6687
06:01:46,220 --> 06:01:47,940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: just for the record,

6688
06:01:48,060 --> 06:01:52,480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: please comply with all the requirements of the DBM

6689
06:01:52,480 --> 06:01:54,820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: for your submissions.

6690
06:01:56,940 --> 06:02:01,440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So that we can...

6691
06:02:01,440 --> 06:02:08,300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So that the funds can be released for this year.

6692
06:02:09,300 --> 06:02:12,720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And subject to the submission of all the requested documents

6693
06:02:12,720 --> 06:02:17,280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: of our members of the committee in the Senate,

6694
06:02:18,200 --> 06:02:22,100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: the budget of the DA, OSEC,

6695
06:02:22,100 --> 06:02:26,340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: together with the attached agencies and corporations,

6696
06:02:26,940 --> 06:02:29,340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: again, subject to the submissions as requested,

6697
06:02:30,160 --> 06:02:33,080
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: is deemed submitted for consideration of the plenary.

6698
06:02:37,400 --> 06:02:41,260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, thank you, Secretary Kiko and the DA family.

6699
